      // ============ 设置/功能相关 ============
      "Hotkeys only work in their respective universes.": "快捷键仅在对应的宇宙中生效。",
      "Disables fancy backgrounds and removes shadows from canvas elements.": "禁用花哨背景并移除画布元素的阴影。",
      "SPOILERS: Save names will spoil parts of the game, tread carefully.": "剧透警告：存档名称会剧透游戏内容，请谨慎浏览。",
      "WARNING: Loading a save will write over your current save.<br>Please export your current save before messing with the savebank.": "警告：载入存档会覆盖当前存档。<br>在折腾存档库之前，请先导出当前存档。",
      "Welcome to the Universe Pauser.<br><small>Paused universes have offline progress.<br>Effect values are not saved on page refresh.</small>": "欢迎来到宇宙暂停器。<br><small>被暂停的宇宙仍会离线推进。<br>效果数值不会在刷新页面时保存。</small>",
      "The savebank allows you to load a save from any part of the game.<br>": "存档库允许你载入游戏任意阶段的存档。<br>",
      "Permanently unlock hex as an otherworldly feature, and change base hex point formula to:<br><small>(log<sub>60</sub>(Celestial Points+1))<sup>0.6</sup></small>": "永久解锁异界特性「咒印」，并将基础咒印点公式改为：<br><small>(log<sub>60</sub>(天体点数+1))<sup>0.6</sup></small>",
      "<h4>This can help by letting you progress in OTFS while infinity is fixed.<br>(and a whole bunch of other stuff eventually)": "<h4>这能帮助你在无限被锁定时推进 OTFS 进度。<br>（以及将来的一大堆其他内容）",
      "<span style='color:red'>WARNING:</span> Achievements are currently <span style='color:red'>WIP</span> and are missing pages and icons.": "<span style='color:red'>警告：</span>成就目前<span style='color:red'>制作中</span>，缺少页面和图标。",
      "Achievements with a green border can be clicked to obtain.": "带绿色边框的成就可以点击领取。",
      "Credits to Sophie for making these saves!": "感谢 Sophie 制作这些存档！",
      "There is currently an excess of leaves.": "目前树叶过剩。",
      "There is currently an excess of code.": "目前代码过剩。",
      "Fun Fact: Without pollinators, all terrestrial ecosystems will collapse.": "趣闻：如果没有授粉者，所有陆地生态系统都将崩溃。",

