      "Secret Message": "秘密信息",
      "Secret Message II": "秘密信息 II",
      "There once was a civilization here a long time ago. We built large cities, filled to the brim with factories. The rich managed to live a comfortable lifestyle while a majority of the population suffered. I ruled that civilization once. I was the civilization's last leader. I thought that giving offerings to the celestials would bring us peace and prosperity. That was a lie. One day, everything changed. A celestial was born in our universe. It was Matos. Matos had been fueled by a deep sense of hatred and anger. He attacked our civilization using large beams of energy, powered by singularity cores. This resulted in the extinction of humanity.": "很久很久以前，这里曾有一个文明。我们建造了巨大的城市，工厂鳞次栉比。富人过着舒适的生活，而大多数人却在受苦。我曾经统治过那个文明。我是那个文明的最后一位领袖。我原以为向 Celestial 献祭会为我们带来和平与繁荣。那是一个谎言。有一天，一切都变了。一个 Celestial 在我们的宇宙中诞生了。它就是 Matos。Matos 被深深的仇恨与愤怒所驱动。它用由奇点核心供能的巨大能量光束攻击我们的文明。这导致了人类的灭绝。",
      "Downside: You can no longer fuel cores, and all your cores are destroyed.": "代价：你将无法再为核心供能，且你所有的核心都将被摧毁。",
