      "<h3>10,000 Singularities": "<h3>10,000 个奇点",
      "Matos, the celestial of machines discovered a way of controlling the power of singularity without being affected by it's negative properties. By extracting the power from singularities and concentrating them into a core. The power is protected by a layer of starmetal, which is a metal extracted from dying stars. However, the singularity core is still unstable. It needs a fuel source in order to be stabilized. With all three of these factors, a the power of singularities can be used through cores. Using these fueled cores, Matos made other celestials stronger.": "机械之 Celestial Matos 发现了一种控制奇点之力、却不受其负面影响的方法。他将力量从奇点中提取出来，凝聚成一枚核心。这股力量由一层星钢保护，星钢是一种从垂死恒星中提取的金属。然而，奇点核心仍不稳定。它需要一种燃料来源才能稳定。凭借这三者，奇点之力便可以通过核心来使用。Matos 用这些充能的核心，让其他 Celestial 变得更强。",
