      "Boost gold gain by x1.01 for each platinum buyable level.": "每级白金可购项将金币获取提升 x1.01。",
      "Reduce the replicanti cooldown by 5% per apathy upgrade.": "每个冷漠升级将复制体冷却降低 5%。",
      "which are multiplying challenge pre-funify exponent by x": "将 乐趣化 前挑战指数乘算 x",
      "Reset previous gwagress, but gwankest up.<br><small>Req:": "重置此前 gwagress，但 gwankest 提升。<br><small>需求：",
      "Unlock bulk gwanking.<br><small>[Kept on Resets]</small>": "解锁批量 gwanking。<br><small>[重置时保留]</small>",
      "Boosts your damage in space battles by x1.5 for the next": "接下来在太空战斗中将你的伤害提升 x1.5",
      "Gain 25% of wheel point mult as wheel points per second.": "每秒获得转盘点倍率 25% 的转盘点。",
