      "<div class='bottomTooltip'>Evolution Bonuses<hr><small>": "<div class='bottomTooltip'>进化加成<hr><small>",
      "Reset previous gwagress, but gwanker up.<br><small>Req:": "重置此前 gwagress，但 gwanker 提升。<br><small>需求：",
      "Gain 500% of all alternate rank currencies per second.": "每秒获得全部异阶位货币的 500%。",
      "Boosts repli-trees and extends repli-tree softcap by x": "提升复制体树，并将复制体树软上限延长 x",
      "<span style='color:#E9D673cc'>Chocolatey Points</span>": "<span style='color:#E9D673cc'>巧克力点数</span>",
