      "Unlock gwankables.<br><small>[Kept on Resets]</small>": "解锁 gwankables。<br><small>[重置时保留]</small>",
      "<h2>Reset only available in Numbness Challenge.</h2>": "<h2>仅可在麻木挑战中重置。</h2>",
