      "Unlock a new bee research": "解锁新的蜜蜂研究",
      "<p style='line-height:1.2'>Milestones multiply tickspeed during celestialite respawn by x": "<p style='line-height:1.2'>里程碑使星灵重生期间的刻速乘算 x",
      "Unlock universe 1's pylon (in the universe's main layer).": "解锁宇宙 1 的尖塔（在该宇宙的主图层中）。",
      "Boost linking power based on singularity points.": "基于奇点点数提升链接威力。",
      "Increases Kres' damage, agility, and regen by +": "提升 Kres 的伤害、敏捷与回复 +",
      "Singularity gain is boosted based on SP gain.": "奇点获取量基于 SP 获取而提升。",
