      "which are multiplying grass and golden grass gain from moonstone by x": "将从月长石获得的草地与金草获取乘算 x",
      "Boosts space rock gain based on total Iridite upgrades purchased. (x": "根据已购买的 Iridite 升级总数提升太空岩石获取。(x",
