      "<h3>Reset replicanti, but gain galaxy dust. (Req: 1e10 replicanti)": "<h3>重置复制体，但获得星系尘埃。（需求：1e10 复制体）",
      "Boosts infinity points based on pent above 12,500.<br>Currently: x": "根据超过 12,500 的 五角 提升无限点。<br>当前：x",
