      "Boost space dust gain by x3. Unlock more space dust buyables.": "将太空尘埃获取提升 x3。解锁更多太空尘埃可购项。",
      "which are multiplying antimatter gain (ignoring softcap) by x": "将反物质获取（无视软上限）乘算 x",
