      "Unlock tree factor VIII and autobuy tree and grass factors.": "解锁树木因子 VIII，并自动购买树木与草地因子。",
      "Boosts moonstone value based on time cubes.<br>Currently: x": "根据时间方块提升月长石价值。<br>当前：x",
      "Boosts core fragment scores based on replicanti points. (x": "根据复制体点提升核心碎片分数。(x",
      "which are reducing space battle level softcap scaling by -": "将太空战斗等级软上限缩放降低 -",
      "Reduces blood battle level softcap scaling by -0.1%.<br>(-": "将鲜血战斗等级软上限缩放降低 -0.1%。<br>(-",
      "<h4>Introduces pests, which do bad things to your grass :(": "<h4>引入害虫，它们会对你的草地干坏事 : (",
