      "Boosts Pre-OTF currencies based on charge:<br>Currently:": "根据充能提升异界特性前的货币：<br>当前：",
      "Gain 10% of grasshoppers and code experience per second.": "每秒获得蚱蜢与代码经验的 10%。",
      "Gain one punchcard selection. (resets on universe exit)": "获得一个穿孔卡选择。（离开宇宙时重置）",
      "Unlock a second prestige effect that buffs grass value.": "解锁第二个强化草地价值的威望效果。",
