      "Boosts singularity point gain based on space rocks. (x": "根据太空岩石提升奇点点数获取。(x",
      "Boosts factor power, rank, tier, and tetr effects by ^": "将因子威力、阶位、阶层与 四角 效果提升 ^",
      "which are boosting prestige points based on grass by x": "将基于草地的威望点提升 x",
