      "Boost star gain (after softcap) based on light.<br>(x": "根据光提升星星获取（软上限之后）。<br>(x",
      "which are multiplying total starmetal alloy gain by x": "将星钢合金总获取乘算 x",
      "Boosts infinity points based on charge:<br>Currently:": "根据充能提升无限点：<br>当前：",
      "Skip the reverse crunch button, and +1 base NIP gain.": "跳过反转挤压按钮，并 +1 基础 NIP 获取。",
      "Unlock an infinitum effect that boosts infinity gain.": "解锁一个提升无限获取的无限质效果。",
      "Improve the \"Flourish\" Iridite upgrade effect by ^4.": "将「繁荣」Iridite 升级效果提升 ^4。",
      "which are boosting negative infinity point gain by x": "将负无限点获取提升 x",
      "Skip the big crunch screen, and automatically reset.": "跳过挤压画面，并自动重置。",
      "Earning an evolution shard from a check back button.": "从回访按钮获得一枚进化碎片。",
      "Also gives +50% matter until I make the achievement.": "在我完成该成就前，还额外提供 +50% 物质。",
      "which are increasing golden grass mult capacity by +": "将金草倍率容量提升 +",
      "<h2>Your pests are killing the grasshoppers,<br>so -": "<h2>你的害虫正在吃掉蚱蜢，<br>因此 -",
      "A superphysical energy cannon powered by starlight.": "一门由星光供能的超物理能量炮。",
      "Unlocks Iridite Zone and Geroa's fighting upgrades.": "解锁 Iridite 区域与 Geroa 的战斗升级。",
