      "Beetles pollinate close to 90% of all flowering plants.": "甲虫为近 90% 的开花植物授粉。",
      "Flies are the dominant pollinator in alpine and subarctic environments.": "蝇类是高山与亚北极环境中的主要授粉者。",
      "300 species of fruit rely on bats for pollination. These include species of bananas, mangoes, and durians.": "有 300 种水果依赖蝙蝠授粉，包括香蕉、芒果和榴莲。",
      "12% of all flowering plants, including most grasses, are wind pollinated.": "包括大多数草类在内，12% 的开花植物靠风授粉。",
      "A fourth of all food production relies on bee pollination.": "全球四分之一的粮食生产依赖蜜蜂授粉。",
      "Butterflies tend to pollinate colorful plants. (Researchers don't study butterflies so this is all I got)": "蝴蝶往往为色彩鲜艳的植物授粉。（研究者不研究蝴蝶，所以我只查到这些）",
