      "Difficulty:": "难度：",
      "Guess:": "猜测：",
      "Well, since my celestial power is being good at puzzles, how about you solve a puzzle to unlock my 升级? Don't worry, it's really easy! Just substitute the numbers with their corresponding letters!": "好吧，既然我的 Celestial 之力就是擅长解谜，不如你来解开一个谜题，解锁我的升级？别担心，这真的很简单！只要把数字替换成对应的字母就行！",
