      "<h3>4x4</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Reach 4 4th dimensionswithout any dim-boostsin infinity challenge 8.Reward: Double AntimatterDimensions.": "<h3>4x4</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>在无限挑战 8 中没有任何维度增幅的情况下达到 4 个第四维度。奖励：反物质维度翻倍。",
      "4x4Reach 4 4th dimensionswithout any dim-boostsin infinity challenge 8.Reward: Double AntimatterDimensions.": "4x4在无限挑战 8 中没有任何维度增幅的情况下达到 4 个第四维度。奖励：反物质维度翻倍。",
      "<h3>Who needs galaxies anyway?</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Reach negative infinity withoutbuying any antimatter galaxies.Reward: +1 base NIP gain.": "<h3>反正谁需要星系呢？</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>不购买任何反物质星系的情况下达到负无限。奖励：+1 基础 NIP 获取。",
      "Who needs galaxies anyway?Reach negative infinity withoutbuying any antimatter galaxies.Reward: +1 base NIP gain.": "反正谁需要星系呢？不购买任何反物质星系的情况下达到负无限。奖励：+1 基础 NIP 获取。",
      "<h3>A little harder...</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Collapse Tav's Domain with acap of at least 1e6 matter.Reward: Increase mattergain by 25%.": "<h3>再难一点……</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>以至少 1e6 物质上限坍缩 Tav 的领域。奖励：物质获取提升 25%。",
      "A little harder...Collapse Tav's Domain with acap of at least 1e6 matter.Reward: Increase mattergain by 25%.": "再难一点……以至少 1e6 物质上限坍缩 Tav 的领域。奖励：物质获取提升 25%。",
      "<h3>Brick by Brick</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Get at least 1 ↻ for eachof the first three pyramidfountains.Reward: Gain 20% more light.": "<h3>一砖一瓦</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>前三个金字塔喷泉各获得至少 1 个 ↻。奖励：光获取提升 20%。",
      "Brick by BrickGet at least 1 ↻ for eachof the first three pyramidfountains.Reward: Gain 20% more light.": "一砖一瓦前三个金字塔喷泉各获得至少 1 个 ↻。奖励：光获取提升 20%。",
      "<h3>A step up...</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Collapse Tav's Domain with acap of at least 1e7 matter.Reward: Increase mattergain by 25%.": "<h3>更上一层……</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>以至少 1e7 物质上限坍缩 Tav 的领域。奖励：物质获取提升 25%。",
      "A step up...Collapse Tav's Domain with acap of at least 1e7 matter.Reward: Increase mattergain by 25%.": "更上一层……以至少 1e7 物质上限坍缩 Tav 的领域。奖励：物质获取提升 25%。",
      "<h3>Oh! That is whereI put that!</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Purchase the forgottenpollen upgradeReward: +50% Pollen+20% Nectar": "<h3>哦！原来我把它放那儿了！</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>购买被遗忘的花粉升级奖励：+50% 花粉+20% 花蜜",
      "Oh! That is whereI put that!Purchase the forgottenpollen upgradeReward: +50% Pollen+20% Nectar": "哦！原来我把它放那儿了！购买被遗忘的花粉升级奖励：+50% 花粉+20% 花蜜",
      "<h3>Big Time</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Store at least 7,200time capsules at once.Reward: Generate twiceas much time energy.": "<h3>大场面</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>同时储存至少 7,200个时间胶囊。奖励：生成两倍的时间能量。",
      "Big TimeStore at least 7,200time capsules at once.Reward: Generate twiceas much time energy.": "大场面同时储存至少 7,200个时间胶囊。奖励：生成两倍的时间能量。",
      "<h3>Not an AD Ach 34 Copy</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Reach negative infinitywithout any 8th dimensions.Reward: +1 base NIP gain.": "<h3>不是 AD 成就 34 的复制品</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>没有第八维度的情况下达到负无限。奖励：+1 基础 NIP 获取。",
      "Not an AD Ach 34 CopyReach negative infinitywithout any 8th dimensions.Reward: +1 base NIP gain.": "不是 AD 成就 34 的复制品没有第八维度的情况下达到负无限。奖励：+1 基础 NIP 获取。",
      "<h3>I sure hope I keepthis a while</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Obtain a θ ↻.Reward: Gain 20%more prism well ↻on collect.": "<h3>真希望我能留这玩意久一点</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>获得一个 θ ↻。奖励：收集时额外获得 20%棱镜井 ↻。",
