      "<h3>You're telling me abee made this bread?</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Do your firstbee bread resetReward: +50% Pollen Gain": "<h3>你是说这面包是蜜蜂做的？</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>进行你的第一次蜂粮重置奖励：+50% 花粉获取",
      "You're telling me abee made this bread?Do your firstbee bread resetReward: +50% Pollen Gain": "你是说这面包是蜜蜂做的？进行你的第一次蜂粮重置奖励：+50% 花粉获取",
      "<h3>Mitochondria is the... wait wrong cell</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Do your firsthoney-cell resetReward: +20% Nectar Gain": "<h3>线粒体是细胞的……等等，跑错细胞了</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>进行你的第一次蜜胞重置奖励：+20% 花蜜获取",
      "Mitochondria is the... wait wrong cellDo your firsthoney-cell resetReward: +20% Nectar Gain": "线粒体是细胞的……等等，跑错细胞了进行你的第一次蜜胞重置奖励：+20% 花蜜获取",
      "<h3>New Effects</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Buy the infinitum upgrade inrow 3, column 3.Reward: Increase mattergain by 50%.": "<h3>新效果</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>购买第 3 行、第 3 列的无限质升级。奖励：物质获取提升 50%。",
