      "<h3>Every Last Drop</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Store at least 7 timecapsules at once.Reward: +1 base timecapsules stored.": "<h3>最后一滴</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>同时储存至少 7 个时间胶囊。奖励：+1 基础时间胶囊储存。",
      "Every Last DropStore at least 7 timecapsules at once.Reward: +1 base timecapsules stored.": "最后一滴同时储存至少 7 个时间胶囊。奖励：+1 基础时间胶囊储存。",
      "<h3>Primary Pollinators</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Buy the 4th pollinatorupgrade.Reward: Increase pollinatorgain by 25%.": "<h3>主要授粉者</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>购买第 4 个授粉者升级。奖励：授粉者获取提升 25%。",
