      "<h3>Unranked</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Prestige without having anyranks/tiers/tetrs.Reward: Increase grass valueby 50%.": "<h3>无阶位</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>没有任何阶位/阶层/四角的情况下威望。奖励：草地价值提升 50%。",
      "UnrankedPrestige without having anyranks/tiers/tetrs.Reward: Increase grass valueby 50%.": "无阶位没有任何阶位/阶层/四角的情况下威望。奖励：草地价值提升 50%。",
      "<h3>Seriously?</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Reach negative infinity withoutany 7th or 8th dimensions.Reward: +1 base NIP gain.": "<h3>认真的？</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>没有第七或第八维度的情况下达到负无限。奖励：+1 基础 NIP 获取。",
      "Seriously?Reach negative infinity withoutany 7th or 8th dimensions.Reward: +1 base NIP gain.": "认真的？没有第七或第八维度的情况下达到负无限。奖励：+1 基础 NIP 获取。",
      "<h3>How many nectarsare there!?!</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Do your firstNectar ε resetReward: +5% CellEffect Base": "<h3>到底有多少种花蜜？！</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>进行你的第一次花蜜 ε 重置奖励：+5% 细胞效果基础值",
