      "<h3>More XP</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Do your first XPBoost reset.Reward: Increase check backXP gain by 50%.": "<h3>更多 XP</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>进行你的第一次 XPBoost 重置。奖励：回访 XP 获取提升 50%。",
