      "<h3>Multiplied Chances</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Gain a second die.Reward: Increase dice pointgain by 25%.": "<h3>倍增的几率</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>获得第二个骰子。奖励：骰子点获取提升 25%。",
