      "<h3>Pest Lover</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>Obtain 250,000 pests.Reward: Grasshops removetwice as many pests.": "<h3>害虫爱好者</h3><hr style='margin-bottom:4px'>获得 250,000 害虫。奖励：蚱蜢跳移除两倍多的害虫。",
