      "Kres a member of the Celestial Hunting Corporation, and was sent out on the mission to the domain of singularity. Originally in the military from one universe's Earth, he joined the corporation when his universe got taken over by celestials.": "Kres 是 Celestial 狩猎公司的一员，被派往奇点领域执行任务。他原本来自某个宇宙地球的军队，在自己的宇宙被 Celestial 占领后加入了公司。",
      "The true story of eclipse is extremely mysterious and shrouded in secrecy. Kres, Nav, and Sel only found him during their first encounter with Matos. Eclipse doesn't speak. They only listen. But Eclipse is an extremely powerful being, that helps the trio during their ventures.": "Eclipse 的真实来历极为神秘，笼罩在秘密之中。Kres、Nav 和 Sel 是在首次遭遇 Matos 时才发现他的。Eclipse 从不说话，只是倾听。但 Eclipse 是极其强大的存在，在三人冒险途中帮助他们。",
      "Once a normal alien being from an unknown universe, Geroa lived a peaceful life until Iridite visited her planet. Iridite caused mass destruction, all in the name of her crazy scientific experimentation. Geroa was considered a valuable test subject by Iridite, and was granted with a fraction of celestial powers. Geroa is currently under the servitude of Iridite, but wants freedom and escape.": "Geroa 曾是来自某个未知宇宙的普通外星生命，过着平静的生活，直到 Iridite 造访她的星球。Iridite 以疯狂科学实验之名造成了大规模毁灭。Geroa 被 Iridite 视为宝贵的实验对象，并被赋予了一小部分 Celestial 力量。Geroa 目前臣服于 Iridite，但渴望自由与逃脱。",
      "Originally a secret weapon of Matos, it has now been further modified and combined with a wasp to create a fierce killing machine. Fortunately, Aleph accidentally gave it free will, so it isn't particularly interested in her goals.": "它原本是 Matos 的秘密武器，如今被进一步改造并与一只黄蜂结合，成为凶猛的杀戮机器。幸运的是，Aleph 意外赋予了它自由意志，所以它对 Matos 的目标并不怎么感兴趣。",
