      "<h2>REMEMBER THE PROTO OVERWORLD.DESTROY CANTE.END THE SUFFERING.</h2><h3>[REQ: 10 Rememberance Cores]</h3>": "<h2>铭记原初主世界。摧毁 Cante。终结苦难。</h2><h3>[需求：10 追忆核心]</h3>",
      "REMEMBER THE PROTO OVERWORLD.DESTROY CANTE.END THE SUFFERING.[REQ: 10 Rememberance Cores]": "铭记原初主世界。摧毁 Cante。终结苦难。[需求：10 追忆核心]",
      "BIG CRUNCH": "大坍缩",
      "You can't pick an otherworldly feature.": "你不能选择异界特性。",
      "Clicking on a check back XP button resets the timer for all other check back XP buttons.": "点击某个回访 XP 按钮会重置所有其他回访 XP 按钮的计时。",
      "ENTER": "进入",
      "Increase first accumulator rows caps by +25.<span style='font-size:8px'>(First effect stops scaling at 50)": "将前几行蓄积器上限提高 +25。<span style='font-size:8px'>（第一个效果在 50 后停止缩放）",
      "Increase first accumulator rows caps by +25.(First effect stops scaling at 50)": "将前几行蓄积器上限提高 +25。（第一个效果在 50 后停止缩放）",
