      "<h1>Condense all your power into singularity points.<small>(Req: 1e40 infinity points)</small></h1><h3>(Singularity gain based on infinity points)</h3>": "<h1>将你全部的力量凝聚为奇点点数。<small>(需求：1e40 无限点)</small></h1><h3>(奇点获取量基于无限点)</h3>",
