      "<h3>v1.4 - The Singularity Update Part I: Cores</h3>": "<h3>v1.4 - 奇点更新 第一部分：核心</h3>",
      "v1.4 - The Singularity Update Part I: Cores": "v1.4 - 奇点更新 第一部分：核心",
      "- Added Singularity, the next large prestige layer.": "- 新增了下一个大型威望图层——奇点。",
      "- Added Singularity Cores. (The Core Assember, and the Core Processor)": "- 新增了奇点核心。（核心组装器与核心处理器）",
      "- Added Radiation.": "- 新增了辐射。",
      "- Added Singularity Dimensions.": "- 新增了奇点维度。",
      "- Added Core Scraps.": "- 新增了核心废料。",
      "- Added Realm Essence.": "- 新增了领域精华。",
      "- Added the Factory.": "- 新增了工厂。",
      "- Added a new celestial: Jocus, the Celestial of Fun.": "- 新增了一位新的 Celestial：欢乐之 Celestial——Jocus。",
      "- Added two new pet evolutions.": "- 新增了两个新的宠物进化。",
      "- Added pet crate automation.": "- 新增了宠物箱子自动化。",
